  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> Training (1) in Melee Weapons</p><p>You are used to fighting side-by-side with your allies.</p><p>When you attack a creature that is within melee range of you and an ally, and you are within <strong>1 space</strong> of that ally, you increase your <strong>Melee</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>If you both have this ability, you increase your <strong>Melee</strong> by <strong>+2</strong>.</p>",
